See CONTRIBUTING.md for development guidelines

# Gumroad Admin SPA Migration Rules

## PROJECT CONTEXT

Rails 7 + React 18 + Inertia.js admin migration project
Repository: antiwork/gumroad
Issue: #1057 - Admin SPA Migration
Goal: Migrate ERB views to React components

## NAMING CONVENTIONS

- Use "buyer" not "customer", "seller" not "creator"
- Components: PascalCase (ProductsIndex.tsx)
- Functions: camelCase
- Tests: ComponentName.spec.tsx
- Test names: No "should", use verbs ("renders", "handles", "displays")

## RAILS CONTROLLER PATTERNS

✅ DO:

- before_action :authorize_admin!
- inertia 'Admin/Category/Component', { data: props }
- Serialize explicitly: map fields, use .iso8601 for dates
- Keep business logic in controller

❌ DON'T:

- render() - use inertia() instead
- Pass sensitive data (api_keys, passwords)
- Use as_json without explicit field list
- Pass Date objects - convert to ISO8601 strings

## REACT COMPONENT PATTERNS

✅ DO:

- TypeScript with explicit interface Props
- Tailwind CSS utility classes ONLY
- import { usePage, Link, router, useForm } from '@inertiajs/react'
- Extract reusable sub-components
- JSON serializable props only

❌ DON'T:

- import CSS or SCSS files
- Use 'any' types in TypeScript
- Hardcode links - use Inertia Link component
- Pass functions or Dates as props

## DATA SERIALIZATION

- JSON serializable: strings, numbers, booleans, objects, arrays, null
- Dates: ALWAYS .iso8601 in controller
- Explicit fields: { id: u.id, email: u.email, created: u.created_at.iso8601 }
- Avoid: functions, symbols, Date objects, methods
- Large collections: paginate (don't pass >100 items)

## STYLING (TAILWIND ONLY)

✅ Buttons: px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 disabled:bg-gray-400
✅ Inputs: w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500
✅ Cards: bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-6
✅ Tables: divide-y divide-gray-200
✅ Mobile first: base then @md, @lg
✅ Test at: 375px, 768px, 1920px

## FORM HANDLING

- useForm: const { data, setData, post, processing, errors } = useForm({ field: value })
- Submit: post('/admin/path', { onError: (e) => handleError(e) })
- Errors: {errors.field && <span>{errors.field}</span>}
- Disabled: disabled={processing}

## TESTING

RSpec (controllers):

- Test Inertia response component name
- Test all props present and correct format
- Test authorization (admin only)
- Test data serialization (dates, numbers)
- No "should" in test names
- Use @example.com for emails

Vitest (components):

- Test rendering with sample data
- Test empty states
- Test all interactive elements
- Test error messages
- Mock Inertia functions
- Use screen queries (getByRole, getByText)

## AUTHORIZATION & SECURITY

- before_action :authorize_admin!
- redirect_to root_path unless current_user.admin?
- Never expose: api_keys, passwords, secrets, tokens
- CSRF auto-protected with Inertia
- Validate & sanitize server-side

## MIGRATION CHECKLIST (STRICT ORDER)

1. Analyze page (data, interactions, styles)
2. Create React component (TypeScript, Tailwind, Inertia)
3. Update Rails controller (inertia(), serialize)
4. Write tests (RSpec + React)
5. Test in browser (desktop, mobile, keyboard)
6. Verify identical to original
7. Create PR (Conventional Commits, reference #1057)

## MIGRATION PRIORITIES

Tier 1 (Start): Index pages, Show pages, Dashboards
Tier 2 (Medium): Search, Forms, Pagination
Tier 3 (Complex): Nested forms, Real-time, Uploads

## VALIDATION COMMANDS

npx tsc --noEmit
npx eslint app/javascript/components/Admin/_.tsx
bundle exec rubocop app/controllers/admin/_.rb
bundle exec rspec spec/controllers/admin/\*\_spec.rb
npm run test

## DEBUGGING

Component not rendering: npx tsc --noEmit, check F12 console
Data not appearing: verify prop names match, check Inertia DevTools
Styles wrong: no CSS imports?, Tailwind built?, npm run build?
Tests fail: verbose mode, check factories, mock data matches?

## COMMIT MESSAGE

feat(admin): Migrate [PageName]#[action] to Inertia React

- Converted Rails ERB to React component with TypeScript
- Migrated SCSS to Tailwind CSS
- Updated controller for Inertia response
- Added comprehensive tests
- No breaking changes

Closes #1057

## FILE STRUCTURE

app/
controllers/admin/[resource]\_controller.rb
javascript/components/Admin/
Common/ (Table, Form, Modal, Pagination, etc)
[Category]/ (Index, Show, Edit, Form)
spec/
controllers/admin/[resource]\_controller_spec.rb
javascript/components/Admin/[Category]/[ComponentName].spec.tsx
